---
import BaseLayout from "../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About GLPDash — GLP-1 Calculator Tools"
  description="GLPDash provides free, private calculators for GLP-1 medications built on published clinical trial data. Learn about our data sources, affiliate model, and medical disclaimer."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#94A3B8] mb-8">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#F8FAFC] transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-[#F8FAFC]">About</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-10">About GLPDash</h1>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-3">What GLPDash is</h2>
        <p>
          GLPDash is a collection of free calculators for people taking or considering GLP-1 medications — Ozempic, Wegovy, Mounjaro, and Zepbound. Our tools help you understand what to expect from these medications based on published clinical trial data, not marketing claims.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We built this because when people start a GLP-1, they have real questions: How much weight might I lose? When do I increase my dose? How much is this going to cost me without insurance? Answering these questions shouldn't require a doctor's appointment or a Google rabbit hole.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-3">What GLPDash is not</h2>
        <p>
          GLPDash is not a medical provider. We don't diagnose, treat, or prescribe. Our calculators provide estimates based on population averages from clinical trials — your individual response will vary, possibly significantly.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Nothing on this site should be interpreted as medical advice. Always consult your healthcare provider before starting, stopping, or changing any medication.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-3">Data sources</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-none">
          {[
            { drug: "Wegovy (semaglutide 2.4mg)", trial: "STEP 1 trial — Wilding et al., N Engl J Med 2021" },
            { drug: "Ozempic (semaglutide 1mg)", trial: "STEP 2 trial — Davies et al., Lancet 2021" },
            { drug: "Mounjaro (tirzepatide)", trial: "SURPASS-2 and SURMOUNT-1 trials — Jastreboff et al., N Engl J Med 2022" },
            { drug: "Zepbound (tirzepatide)", trial: "SURMOUNT-1 trial — same dataset as Mounjaro" },
          ].map(({ drug, trial }) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] mt-2" />
              <div>
                <span class="text-[#F8FAFC] font-medium">{drug}:</span>{" "}
                {trial}
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
          Dose escalation schedules are derived from FDA-approved prescribing information for each medication. Drug pricing is updated manually and reflects estimates from GoodRx and telehealth providers — actual prices vary by pharmacy, location, and insurance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-3">Our affiliate model</h2>
        <p>
          GLPDash earns a commission when you sign up for a GLP-1 program through our partner links (Ro Health, Hims/Hers). This is how we cover our costs and keep the tools free.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Our affiliate relationships do not influence our calculator data, drug comparisons, or recommendations. We show all four major GLP-1 medications equally and present pricing data from multiple channels including non-affiliate options like GoodRx and retail pharmacies.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We only partner with telehealth providers that prescribe FDA-approved, brand-name GLP-1 medications through licensed physicians. We do not partner with compounding pharmacies selling unapproved semaglutide or tirzepatide formulations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F59E0B]/5 border border-[#F59E0B]/20">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC] mb-3">Medical disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">
          The information provided by GLPDash is for informational and educational purposes only. It is not intended to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition or medication.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
          Weight loss projections are estimates based on averages from published clinical trials conducted under controlled conditions. Individual results vary based on starting weight, adherence to medication, diet, physical activity, metabolic factors, and other variables. The clinical trial populations may not represent your individual situation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
          Drug pricing information is provided for general comparison purposes and may not reflect the price you will pay at your specific pharmacy. Prices change frequently and vary by location, insurance coverage, and pharmacy.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-[#F59E0B]">
          If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 or go to your nearest emergency room immediately.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
